  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Incoming mission OC alumni</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project builds on the rapid growth of the Orange Corners alumni network, which has created a need for more structured post-programme support and improved access to international networks, knowledge, finance, and market opportunities. It aims to support 10 selected alumni in building strong and sustainable relationships with the Netherlands, contributing to the professionalisation and growth of their businesses while also increasing the visibility of Orange Corners alumni within the Dutch entrepreneurial ecosystem. This is achieved through a tailored 5-7-day immersion visit to the Netherlands, embedded in a broader needs-driven programme with pre- and post-components. The in-person element enables a level of engagement, exchange, and connection that cannot be achieved online. The project targets entrepreneurs from Orange Corners programme countries.</narrative>
  </description>
